    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pakistan has around 1.5 million adults who have impaired sight due to various eye conditions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "World Sight Day is an international day to raise awareness about blindness and vision impairment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This year, for the first time, it was formally celebrated in Karachi by the Ophthalmological Society of Pakistan (OSP), Karachi Branch and AKU's Ophthalmology Section."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Every year World Sight Day is organized on the second Thursday in October. This day provides a reminder that the World Health Organisation - and its Vision 2020: The Right to Sight - has called for the elimination of preventable blindness."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The OPS and AKU event hosted a number of presentations by specialists in adult and paediatric eye diseases."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"The key to fighting blindness is early detection and appropriate treatment,\" emphasized Dr Irfan Jeeva, assistant professor and service line chief of Eye and ENT. \"This includes awareness of your condition, accessibility of healthcare services and advances in technology.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A reminder for us all: 'Eyesight is a blessing, please do not take it for granted.'"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
